# ============================================================================
# == Mesa Vulkan drivers + NVIDIA GSP firmware (Zink on NVK)                ==
# ============================================================================
#
# The OpenGL half of Mesa (libgl1-mesa-dri, mesa-libgallium, libvulkan1) is
# already pulled in underneath this module by Xorg and Plasma.  What is
# missing for NVIDIA cards on nouveau is:
#
#   mesa-vulkan-drivers       NVK (libvulkan_nouveau.so).  Mesa's loader only
#                             picks Zink for nouveau when a Vulkan driver for
#                             the card is present; otherwise it stays on the
#                             old nouveau GL driver.
#   firmware-nvidia-graphics  GSP-RM firmware.  Turing and newer need it for
#                             NVK; Ada and Blackwell do not come up at all
#                             without it.  firmware-linux-nonfree does NOT
#                             depend on it, so 02-firmware never installs it.
#
# The `install` script refuses to build if Mesa is older than 25.
mesa-vulkan-drivers
firmware-nvidia-graphics +dp=debian
